#. Tag: title
#: man-khangman.6.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-khangman.6.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&khangman; is a game based on the well known hangman game. It is aimed for "
"children 6 and above. It has several levels of difficulty: A lot of "
"categories like Animals (animals words) and Easy, Medium and Hard."
msgstr ""
"&khangman; je igra bazirana na dobro poznatoj igri vješala. Namjenjena djeci "
"od 6 godina i više. Ima više nivoa različite težine: Razne kategorije tipa "
"Životinje(životinjski svijet) i Lako, Srednje i Teško."

#. Tag: para
#: man-khangman.6.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A word is picked at random and the letters are hidden. You must guess the "
"word by trying one letter after another. Each time you guess a wrong letter, "
"part of a picture of a hangman is drawn. You must guess the word before "
"getting hanged! You have 10 tries."
msgstr ""
"Nasumično se bira riječ a slova se sakriju. Morate pogoditi riječ koristeći "
"slovo po slovo. Svaki put kad progriješite slovo, crta se dio slike na "
"vješalu. Morate pogoditi riječ prije nego je slika gotova! imate 10 pokušaja."

#. Tag: para
#: man-khangman.6.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "This application is part of the &kde; Edutainment module."
msgstr "Ova aplikacija je dio &kde;  modula zabavnog učenja."

